-- **Uncertainty:** The show never explains why she cannot fly; creator-adjacent statements conflict, and the profile follows the screen — unexplained, improving hover, no flight by the epilogue. The aunts' household comes from chapter books; S9E12 shows them visiting instead. The clubhouse's exact site is unmapped.
